<title>INDIA: CADBURY INDIA SLUMPS 10 PCT ON LOWER NET.</title>
<headline>CADBURY INDIA SLUMPS 10 PCT ON LOWER NET.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Cadbury India fell 34.0 rupees, or nearly ten percent, to 312.0 at the Bombay exchange on Thursday after the firm announced a sharp drop in its first half net profit, dealers said.</p>
</text>
